    "k330": "[9] CES Intelligence, “AI Sovereignty 2026: Export Controls, EU AI Act &amp; Corporate Risk,” Apr 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.ces-intelligence.com/analysis/ai-sovereignty-export-controls-2026\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ces-intelligence.com</a>",
