    "k332": "[11] BBC News, “Anthropic AI created fake profiles to deceive people in attempted hack,” Aug 2026 — <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c1w1lvn7d9go\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">bbc.com</a>; liputan CNBC — <a href=\"https://www.cnbc.com/2026/08/05/anthropic-mythos-openai-security-breaches.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">cnbc.com</a>",
